spec ProfileWatchReplies.tla
check INVARIANTS TypeOK NoStaleApply NoInactiveApply SingleWorker
check PROPERTIES BusyClears
reach PausedQueued | requests=1 changes=2
reach StaleQueued | requests=1 changes=2
reach ClosedQueued | requests=1 changes=2
reach ErrorDrained | requests=1 changes=2
reach DisabledQueued | requests=1 changes=2
reach IdentityABA | requests=1 changes=3
run requests=0 changes=0 | Keys={a} Requests=0 Changes=0
run requests=1 changes=2 | Keys={a,b} Requests=1 Changes=2
run requests=1 changes=3 | Keys={a,b} Requests=1 Changes=3
run requests=2 changes=2 | Keys={a,b} Requests=2 Changes=2
run requests=3 changes=1 | Keys={a} Requests=3 Changes=1
